    "text": "1 days ago\nSeifert wins Beaufort sheriff; Ford takes Jasper probate seat; Hilton Head returns incumbents; Beaufort council contest falls within recount threshold. Beaufort and Jasper county voters chose new leaders Tuesday, Nov. 3, in an election that brought a change in Beaufort County’s sheriff, a new Jasper County probate judge and a historic Democratic victory in South Carolina’s U.S. Senate race.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
